# Copy to .dev.vars for `wrangler dev` (gitignored). Production values go in
# via `wrangler secret put` (SPEC.md §3.3).
JWT_KEY=dev-only-key-change-me-0123456789-0123456789-01234567
INGEST_API_KEY=dev-only-ingest-key
# OneSignal REST API key (dashboard → Settings → Keys & IDs). Without it, pushes
# are skipped with a warning instead of failing the request.
# ONESIGNAL_API_KEY=os_v2_app_...
# No mail credentials: verification/reset delivery is mocked (src/core/mailer.ts),
# which logs each link instead of sending it.
